  "body_text": "终于，要开课了\n第一期课程 - 咖啡冲煮（手冲）\n对象：所有人\n讲师：Tommy 王遴\n课程要点：\n冲煮（手冲）系统的介绍（影响冲煮的要素分析）\n不同烘焙产品有冲煮的结合应用 （重点部分）\n课程用豆：\n多种，超乎你想象的多！！！\n器具：\n我决定不了，临场看Tommy老师想用啥就用啥\n但工作室器我叫的来名字和叫不出的器具属实有很多\n水系统：\nRO （TDS < 30)\nRO+BWT Mg (TDS ~60)\n调配水 (TDS ~110)\n时间：\n8/29 周六 上午10:30 - 结束\n地点：浦东芳华路139号C109\n课程链接：扫描下面小程序二维码直达\n可使用会员折扣\n小编的唠叨\n课程开设的动机不是想做培训而做培训，还是想从一个烘焙商的角度出发，把烘焙的产品延伸的服务部分做好，我们的豆子还算是比较丰富，结合这些自有产品，涵盖不同的产区，品种，处理方式，烘焙程度，将冲煮这个应用的环节做好，是我们想在这门课程里覆盖到的，这门课程可能还会有Pt.2，让我们先做一期看看。\n目前在规划的课程还有：冲煮（意式）与烘焙\nStay tuned~",
  "body_html": "<div class=\"rich_media_content js_underline_content\" id=\"js_content\" style=\"visibility: hidden; opacity: 0; \">\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          终于，要开课了\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          第一期课程 - 咖啡冲煮（手冲）\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          对象：所有人\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          讲师：Tommy 王遴\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          课程要点：\n         </span>\n</section>\n<ul class=\"list-paddingleft-2\" style=\"width: 577.4166870117188px;white-space: normal;list-style-type: circle;\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            冲煮（手冲）系统的介绍（影响冲煮的要素分析）\n           </span>\n</section>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            不同烘焙产品有冲煮的结合应用 （重点部分）\n           </span>\n</section>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          课程用豆：\n         </span>\n</section>\n<ul class=\"list-paddingleft-2\" style=\"list-style-type: circle;\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n           多种，超乎你想象的多！！！\n          </section>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          器具：\n         </span>\n</section>\n<ul class=\"list-paddingleft-2\" style=\"list-style-type: circle;\">\n<li>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            我决定不了，临场看Tommy老师想用啥就用啥\n           </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            但工作室器我叫的来名字和叫不出的器具属实有很多\n           </span>\n</section>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          水系统：\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<ul class=\"list-paddingleft-2\" style=\"list-style-type: circle;\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            RO （TDS &lt; 30)\n           </span>\n</section>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            RO+BWT Mg (TDS ~60)\n           </span>\n</section>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            调配水 (TDS ~110)\n           </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n</span>\n</section>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"f